(EDU-410 SYNTHETIC MANUAL - revision 1) Tj
T* (Fictional teaching controller. Not Saturn equipment.) Tj
T* (Purpose: collect sensor values in a classroom test stand.) Tj
T* (Supply: 24 V DC. Disconnect supply before wiring.) Tj
T* (Digital inputs: 4. Analog inputs: 2.) Tj
T* (Do not use these invented values in an engineering project.) Tj
ET
