(EDU-410 - Diagnostic procedure) Tj
T* (If the controller does not reply, check the 24 V supply.) Tj
T* (Then check the Modbus address and A/B polarity.) Tj
T* (A status LED flashes once per second in the synthetic test.) Tj
T* (No wireless interface is specified in this manual.) Tj
T* (Contact a teacher if the fictional test cannot be completed.) Tj
ET
